data: {"id": "e93d3b1dfde9497c-thinking-parallel_evidence-437", "run_id": "e93d3b1dfde9497c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=617 lines=10\nInvestigation plan updated with 6 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 2 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [step3] kubectl_previous_logs -", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789073855228, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_620f8f7e19154b4590bcb5e0", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=617 lines=10\nInvestigation plan updated with 6 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 2 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [step3] kubectl_previous_logs - 确认崩溃前应用日志\n[ ] [step4] kubectl_events - 获取 Liveness/OOM/Killing 事件\n[ ] [step5] kubectl_logs_grep CONFIG_MISSING - 在 current logs 中精确定位崩溃前的错误\n[ ] [step6] query_pod_tracing(trace_id=c6ffc9838e9b589ff9c084aa2ea07c2f) - 深入查看 CONFIG_MISSING 的调用链路\n[~] [step1] kubectl_describe - 验证 Exit Code、Last State Reason 及 Probe 事件\n[~] [step2] kubectl_get_yaml - 检查 Command/Args/Image/Resources 配置\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e93d3b1dfde9497c-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e93d3b1dfde9497c-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e93d3b1dfde9497c-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

