data: {"id": "e93d3b1dfde9497c-thinking-parallel_evidence-840", "run_id": "e93d3b1dfde9497c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据工具返回结果，开始第一轮关键事实采集：\n\n1.  **kubectl_previous_logs**: 失败，提示 \"unable to retrieve container logs\"。这说明前一个容器实例的日志已不可用（可能因 containerd 清理或日志驱动限制），无法直接获取崩溃前的应用输出。\n2.  **kubectl_events**: 返回关键事件：`Back-off restarting failed container app` (x110 over 27m)，UID 为 `5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26`。这证实了持续的 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。\n3.  **kubectl_get_yaml**:\n    *   镜像: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n    *   命令: `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n    *   容器状态: `ready=False`, `restarts=10`, `", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789073891823, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

