data: {"id": "e93d3b1dfde9497c-thinking-parallel_evidence-869", "run_id": "e93d3b1dfde9497c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=605 lines=11\nInvestigation plan updated with 7 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 6 completed, 1 in progress, 0 pending\n[~] [step7] Synthesize: 确认根本原因\n[✓] ", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789073897291, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_0eebc7321f7b44ceaad3d7a3", "tool_sequence": 8, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=605 lines=11\nInvestigation plan updated with 7 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 6 completed, 1 in progress, 0 pending\n[~] [step7] Synthesize: 确认根本原因\n[✓] [step1] kubectl_describe - 验证 Exit Code、Last State Reason 及 Probe 事件\n[✓] [step2] kubectl_get_yaml - 检查 Command/Args/Image/Resources 配置\n[✓] [step4] kubectl_events - 获取 Liveness/OOM/Killing 事件\n[✓] [step3] kubectl_previous_logs - 确认崩溃前应用日志\n[✓] [step5] kubectl_logs_grep CONFIG_MISSING - 在 current logs 中精确定位崩溃前的错误\n[✓] [step6] query_pod_tracing - 深入查看 CONFIG_MISSING 的调用链路\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e93d3b1dfde9497c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e93d3b1dfde9497c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e93d3b1dfde9497c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

