事实。\n3.  **系统状态**：K8s 事件和指标均一致反映了 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（证据 #2, #5），排除了其他非配置类故障（如 OOMKill 或镜像拉取失败）的可能性。\n\n**缺失事实：**\n尽管根因已确认为“配置缺失”，但输入中 `unknowns` 明确指出缺失的具体配置项名称（Key）及对应的 ConfigMap/Secret 完整内容不可知，且无法获取崩溃前最后一次容器进程的底层日志以定位具体代码行号。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 97.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 97.3s (Evidence 87.4s, RCA 9.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 127.324, "metrics": {"run_id": "e93d3b1dfde9497c", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 127.32785820960999, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "c